Desktopia (this fork)
---------------------
Desktopia is an unofficial macOS version based on Deskland Preview v0.1.3
(https://github.com/BLEZZ0102/Deskland, commit 9818b57). It is not affiliated with
or endorsed by the Deskland authors.

Modifications made in November 2026:
- Added a native macOS host (Package.swift, Sources/Desktopia/, scripts/).
- Added the original "Woodland" theme (themes-mac/).
- prototype/, host/ and tools/ are unchanged from upstream.

The modifications are also licensed under GNU GPL version 3.
